Clara Wang: Idea: run a fast 9-day microtest around Prompt Templates + starter credits. Two arms: "Claim-after-RSVP" 45 credits vs "Instant-Grant" 160 credits. Goal: clear 7-day activation signal and template conversion. Need: landing, 3 socials, a 10-min demo deck, routing tag, and two onboarding nudge variants.

Diego Morales: Yes. Suggest limiting cohort to 700-900 per arm. Track events: template_open, template_apply, credits_redeemed, demo_completed. Also capture which template category they try (outreach, docs, code).

Rhea Patel: I'll own copy + deck + webinar ops. Proposed webinar title: "Templates that Actually Work: Real Prompts, Real Results". Keep demo to 12min + 2 short customer mini-demos. CTA language: "RSVP to claim credits" vs "Start with credits now".

Sam O'Neill: Routing: append ?exp=pt_claim or pt_instant to signup links, push cohort tag into CRM, and route likely prospects (company_size>50 or job=engineer) to AE queue. Pseudo: 

```
const exp = req.query.exp || 'pt_instant';
crm.tag(userId, `experiment:${exp}`);
if (exp === 'pt_claim') {
  routeTo('ae_hot', {priority: 'high'});
} else {
  routeTo('growth_inbound');
}
```

SchedulerBot: Experiment logged: id=pt_micro_20240515. Dashboard stub: https://growth.internal/exp/pt_micro_20240515. Budget guard: 220k tokens/arm. Alerts enabled.

Clara Wang: Great. Onboarding nudge A/B: A (micro): "Try a template in 2 minutes  [Open templates]" B (guided): "Follow a 2-step guided template setup with examples  [Start guide]". We'll compare click->apply.

Diego Morales: Analytics plan: daily funnel counts, snapshots day2/day5/day9, and a cohort chart for template reuse at day7. I'll instrument a 'template_edit' event too.

Rhea Patel: Social cadence: teaser (48h), teaser follow (24h) with a stat-led micro case, and CTA morning-of. I'll make assets for LinkedIn and X and upload to /drive/marketing/prompt-templates-micro (comments enabled).

Sam O'Neill: I'll push routing to staging and add unit tests for CRM tag flow. Also will make sure rep view surfaces credits & cohort so AEs can mention in outreach.

Clara Wang: Owners: Rhea (copy + slides + webinar ops), Diego (metrics + dashboard), Sam (routing + CRM), Clara (comms + benchmark one-pager). Launch target: Mon 2024-05-20. Quick check-in Thurs for drafts.

Rhea Patel: Draft email subject lines: 1) "Try Prompt Templates — instant wins" 2) "RSVP to claim credits + watch a 12-min demo". I'll add three preheaders and A/B picks.

Diego Morales: Putting event names and a funnel stub into the analytics board now. Will share perms.

SchedulerBot: Reminder: staging routing must be verified by Fri 2024-05-17 17:00 UTC or launch delayed.

Clara Wang: Thanks team. Please drop links and mocks here when ready. We'll review mock numbers in Friday's 11am sync. :rocket:
